WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:45.610 --> 00:01:49.760
We met Tori Mifuyu-chan at our snowboarding lessons.

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:54.890
She's a nice, enthusiastic girl who gets nervous before competitions, and she has a Guardian Character.

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:58.050
As fellow Character Bearers, we got along great.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:02.110
But on the day of the big snowboarding competition,

00:02:02.110 --> 00:02:04.830
Mifuyu-chan seemed a little strange.

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:07.790
What happened to you, Mifuyu-chan?

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:14.160
Battle in the Snow! Save Snoppe!

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:14.160
Episode 15

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.600
Tori Mifuyu's X Egg

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.790
is perfectly suitable to be my first test subject.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:39.180
This is the only equipment I have on hand, but it'll be enough to gather data.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:46.850
It's no good.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.030
I can't do anything.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.790
Mifuyu-chan!

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.710
Mifuyu-chan, what's wrong?

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:54.790
Guys...

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.120
You came after me?

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.620
Find her?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.030
Nope.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:02:59.960
What's wrong?

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.070
Snoppe is missing.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.920
What?

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.850
Mifuyu-chan, where's Snoppe?

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:06.100
I don't know.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:07.810
I...

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.860
Snoppe is not just missing;

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:13.240
her presence cannot be felt at all.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.320
Does that mean she's not nearby?

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.670
Mifuyu-chan can't do her run like this!

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.450
Yeah.

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:23.290
It's as if her heart's egg were missing...

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:27.230
Ms. Tori, are you all right? You look a bit pale.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.160
I-I...

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:33.300
Mifuyu-chan just isn't feeling well at the moment, but she'll be better soon.

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:35.010
O-Okay.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.870
When is Tori-san's start time?

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:40.350
Um, in about thirty minutes, I think.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.700
We don't have much time.

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:44.100
Let's go, Hinamori-san!

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.310
Yeah.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:48.960
Mifuyu-chan, we'll definitely bring Snoppe back.

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:50.170
So just wait for us!

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.310
Amu-chan.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:05.770
What?!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.510
I think I was just here!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.150
I came all this way just to see Hinamori-senpai,

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.160
but I'm pretty sure I'm lost!

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:18.520
Where am I?!

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:21.200
Kiseki!

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:21.880
Right!

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:22.650
Temari!

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:23.460
Yes!

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.100
Daichi!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:24.840
Yeah!

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:25.620
Ran!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.410
Yeah!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.700
Character Change!

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:38.390
What should we do? She's nowhere to be found.

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:41.990
Don't worry. We should be able to feel the egg's presence somewhere.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.100
We must concentrate.

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:45.450
I'm counting on you, Daichi.

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:46.930
Leave it to me!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.980
We should be able to tell if we're getting close!

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:51.470
Let's split up and search!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.200
Good idea.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.070
She nailed it!

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:59.680
She can expect a high score for that.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:01.820
What a beautiful turn.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.830
Her upper body was completely stable.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.450
Amazing!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.090
She's really good.

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.000
Snoppe!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.120
Where are you?

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:17.730
Come out!

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:20.860
Well? Did you sense anything?

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:23.670
No, nothing yet.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.080
How did you do, Amu-chan?

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.590
Don't worry, we'll find her!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.590
Yeah.

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:32.390
Let's go!

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.120
I knew it.

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:42.990
It's as powerful as I thought, perhaps even more so.

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:46.720
Excuse me!

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:49.440
I'd like to ask for some directions!

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.360
Excuse me!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.430
Pardon my intrusion.

00:05:57.350 --> 00:06:00.620
I could've sworn someone was here.

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:05.190
I guess it was my imagination.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.690
Sorry to have bothered you!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.810
What was that sound?

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.200
An egg?

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:18.020
Oh! I mustn't! I mustn't!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.090
I mustn't go looking at people's things.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.790
Pardon me!

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.000
Why was he here?

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:35.530
I can't count on there being no more interruptions.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.620
I should take some precautions.

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:43.850
It's no good. I can't do my run like this.

00:06:43.850 --> 00:06:47.520
I'm not strong enough to live up to everyone's expectations.

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.940
I never have been!

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.610
Snoppe.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:53.760
Mifuyu-chan.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:18.850
When Yamabuki Saya, celebrity of the slopes, watches an event, nothing less will do!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:19.450
Right?

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:20.580
Of course!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:24.880
Standing out in the cold, like some normal spectator, is just unacceptable.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.510
Right?

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:26.920
Of course!

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.940
Why is Yamabuki-san the only one who gets that?

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:29.740
Yeah...

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.190
Hey, that's Tori-san, isn't it?

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:37.530
It is. I wonder what's going on.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.470
Oh! I hear voices!

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:44.390
I'm saved!

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:49.630
Hinamori-sen-

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.350
Are you okay?

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.700
Wait, why are you here?

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.390
You look as lovely in your snowboarding outfit as I imagined!

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:59.020
Uh, not really...

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:03.680
Did you come here just to see Amu-chan?

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:08.210
Yes! I was watching TV at my grandma's house and I saw her, so...

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.960
I didn't think I could consider myself her fan unless I came here!

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:13.330
Oh, really.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:15.260
Is your grandmother's house nearby?

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:19.830
It's about an hour by train. I was like, "I'm really lucky I happened to be staying here!"

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:20.950
You're something else.

00:08:22.750 --> 00:08:24.970
More importantly, did anyone find anything?

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.910
Nothing, not a clue.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.310
Not me.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.990
I didn't find anything either.

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:34.920
As Guardians, it's really pathetic that we can't find one little egg!

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.540
Um...

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:38.880
You're looking for an egg?

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.690
Oh, it's nothing for you to worry about.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:42.900
I'm sorry.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.060
What'll we do? Go out looking again?

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.020
I guess so.

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.750
Isn't there a supermarket around here?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.500
Or a grocery store? Or a convenience store?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.020
You be quiet.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:52.910
Sorry!

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.460
Um...

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:56.820
I told you to...

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:58.040
Now, now...

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.120
I saw an egg in a mountain cabin a little while ago.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:01.990
What?!

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:02.950
R-Really?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.430
Where is it? Where's the cabin?

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:06.620
But it looked like there was only one!

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.030
And it might've been past its expiration date!

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:11.270
It might not've been enough for an omelet!

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:14.300
No! Tell us about the cabin, not omelets!

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:16.510
You don't want to fry one?

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.400
Well?

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.440
No good. I didn't see a cabin anywhere.

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:44.310
I guess we have no choice but to search on foot.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.810
But it's strange...

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.280
He's not a Character Bearer, so why would he be able to see the egg?

00:09:49.280 --> 00:09:53.550
It certainly is strange. It's possible that it's a completely unrelated egg.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:54.850
Oh no...

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.600
But maybe...

00:09:56.600 --> 00:09:59.860
Maybe it's because he gave birth to his own egg once.

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.250
Indeed.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:06.070
Though it did become an X Egg.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:07.960
Still, there's a chance.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.160
None of this matters!

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:13.020
We must find Snoppe, quickly!

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:16.410
She's right. This is our only lead at the moment.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.890
Yeah, let's hurry!

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.460
That's odd.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:25.660
The readings have become unstable.

00:10:25.660 --> 00:10:28.290
There shouldn't be any errors in the program.

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:33.650
Maybe there's less energy than I thought.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:37.350
After all, with just this one tiny egg...

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:42.370
That's it! If I gather the negative energy from this X Egg...

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:47.350
Search for the Embryo when its location is unknown?

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:50.430
That foolish treasure hunt ends now.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:53.000
I don't have to find one, I'll <i>make</i> one.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.370
I'll make an Embryo with my own hands!

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:03.830
I feel the presence of an egg!

00:11:03.830 --> 00:11:04.660
An egg?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:05.710
Is it Snoppe?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.710
It's similar to Snoppe, but...

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:08.950
This is...

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.490
It's an X Egg, Amu-chan!

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:13.560
An X Egg? What do you mean?

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:14.790
Hinamori-san, look at that!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.350
Snoppe's in there?

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.780
Let's go, Amu-chan.

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:19.540
Yeah.

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.500
Another interruption?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:32.200
The Guardians?

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.870
Those annoying brats.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:37.350
This cable...

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:42.100
I see, this is what was disturbing the readings.

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.540
That brat must've done it.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.310
Oh well, I've collected enough data.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.700
This egg is no longer...

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.600
No, this powerful negative energy...

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.800
There's still a way to use it.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.280
I should try it out.

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:04.720
This is not good! The presence of the X Egg is rapidly increasing!

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:05.750
It can't be!

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:08.600
Yeah, an X Character is about to be born.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:09.120
Damn!

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:16.940
Was that Nikaidou-sensei?

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:18.600
Why would he be out here?

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.000
Amu-chan, hurry!

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:20.960
R-Right!

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.270
Let's go.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:28.220
Yeah!

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:34.370
It's an X Egg!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:37.510
No, that's Snoppe!

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:38.930
Really, Su?

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:40.220
It must be.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.130
It's faint, but I feel Snoppe's presence.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:46.250
I don't know why she turned into an X Egg, though.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:47.970
We have to save her, quickly.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:50.680
Hinamori-san!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:52.410
The X Egg is...

00:12:52.410 --> 00:12:52.870
What?

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.970
Snowboard!

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.810
It hatched!

00:13:05.810 --> 00:13:08.270
Snoppe! You're Snoppe, aren't you?

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.920
Oh no. It looks like she doesn't remember who she is.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.080
Snoppe!

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.430
We're at a disadvantage here. Let's go out back.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:22.160
Yeah.

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:23.140
Kiseki!

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:27.140
Holy Crown!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.560
Now, everyone!

00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:40.460
Amu-chan, Character Transform!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.350
Right!

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.640
My heart:

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:47.090
Unlock!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.550
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:36.530
Back Hinamori-san up, everyone!

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:37.960
Let's go, Kukai!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:38.580
Yeah!

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.140
Character Change!

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:44.140
Over here!

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:01.840
Inside is one thing, but try hitting me out here in the open!

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:11.910
They're chasing us!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.350
Kukai!

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:18.310
Daichi!

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.640
Man, I don't feel like doing anything.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:21.440
Maybe I'll go to sleep.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.270
What?

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:24.640
W-What is this?

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:25.540
Soma-kun!

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:31.920
Tadase-kun!

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:33.560
Kiseki!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.910
I don't want to do this anymore.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.200
Perhaps world domination is impossible.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.060
What?

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:41.950
What's happening to everyone?

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:45.300
If those snowmen hit you, they appear to sap all your motivation.

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.000
What? They can do that?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.380
It's here!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:50.350
Temari!

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:51.170
As you wish!

00:15:53.350 --> 00:15:54.560
Character Change!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:16:00.030
Please don't... don't expect anything of me!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:03.480
Don't expect anything!

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:07.390
This is the strongest opponent we've faced so far.

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:08.740
Amu-chan, please!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.100
B-But even Kukai and Tadase-kun were no match for it.

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.220
What're you gettin' scared for?

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.700
N-Nadeshiko-san, you're doing that here?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.790
If this keeps up, whatcha think's gonna happen to Mifuyu?

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.540
Just ignore the pressure and get to it!

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.020
Mifuyu-chan.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:28.650
Here it comes!

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.250
Amu-chan, draw the "no!"

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.900
No, "person!"

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:32.290
Hit yourself in the head with your fists!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:40.810
It's huge!

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:45.770
Fall back!

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.560
What're you doin'?

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:51.290
No, no, no, no... Person, person, person, person...

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:56.720
Just wait, Mifuyu-chan, Snoppe! I'll save you both.

00:16:57.480 --> 00:16:58.920
Negative Heart:

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.860
Lock On!

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:07.080
Open Heart!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.650
Amu-chan, thank you.

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:31.270
Snoppe, hurry back to Mifuyu-chan!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:32.740
Okay!

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.750
Thank goodness!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:43.910
You're back to normal, too.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.120
What happened to me?

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.660
I suddenly felt all...

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:53.910
My ambition has been restored!

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:11.570
An egg?

00:18:11.570 --> 00:18:12.600
Snoppe!

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:17.750
It's as if I had been sleeping.

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.180
Snoppe.

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:24.630
Um, this just in:

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:28.690
Entry #11, Tori Mifuyu, has decided to withdraw.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:31.450
Is she ill, perhaps? How unfortunate.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:33.320
Well then, the next competitor-

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:36.470
Wait! I'll go! I'll do my run!

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:39.670
I'll get ready! Like, right now!

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.820
She appears to be just fine.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.760
Oh!

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:50.780
There she is!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:52.500
She made it after all.

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.630
Snoppe is with her, too.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.470
What a relief.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.590
And now for Tori Mifuyu's highly anticipated appearance!

00:19:01.590 --> 00:19:04.610
What sort of run will we see today?

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:06.960
The "no" character!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:07.710
"Person!"

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.680
Hit your head with your fists!

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:12.670
Mifuyu-chan, they all work!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.820
You guys.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.150
Mifuyu-chan, are you okay?

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:17.470
Snoppe.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.690
It's okay if you fail.

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:23.200
Having fun even if you fall is exactly the way you snowboard.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.670
You're right.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.360
We'll have fun, even if we fail.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:32.800
Here we go,

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:33.720
Snoppe!

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:34.830
Okay!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:01.280
Wow.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.950
All right!

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.180
Good job!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:34.890
Thanks for everything, you guys.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:37.400
Looks like you made the World Championship team.

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.780
Aw, it's all thanks to you.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.470
See you, Snoppe.

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:42.420
Bye-bye.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.050
We'll miss you.

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.740
If you find the Embryo, inform me immediately!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.570
Let's meet again.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.590
See ya. Take care of yourself.

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:53.200
Good-bye, everyone.

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:54.960
Amu-chan,

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.660
I'm really glad I was able to meet you guys.

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.350
Huh?

00:20:58.350 --> 00:20:59.970
What's this all of a sudden?

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:01.610
It's not like we won't ever see each other again.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.980
True!

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:06.820
See you! I'll teach you more about snowboarding next year!

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.620
Like this!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:20.130
Bye, guys! Take care!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.460
See you!

00:21:27.950 --> 00:21:29.740
Let's go for another run.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:30.840
Okay!

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.200
It certainly was an eventful trip, wasn't it?

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.780
No kidding!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.300
That was definitely Nikaidou-sensei.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:48.780
What if the one who's been drawing out the X Eggs wasn't Ikuto.

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:50.810
Could it be Nikaidou-sensei?

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:51.820
Hinamori-senpai!

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:52.700
W-What?

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:57.350
I never thought I'd get to go back with you!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:59.890
But is it okay for you not to go back to your grandma's house?

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:02.110
You come before Grandma.

00:22:02.110 --> 00:22:03.660
I don't understand...

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:09.200
And now it is time for me, Yamabuki Saya, the school's number one celebrity, to sing!

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.950
Ms. Tour Guide, the usual, please.

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:18.240
Something like this happened before...

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:53.880
Ouch. I snowboarded too much, and now I'm totally sore.

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:58.320
I can fix that in an instant with my magic!

00:23:58.320 --> 00:23:58.920
One.

00:23:58.920 --> 00:23:59.410
Two.

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:00.140
Three!

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:01.480
Huh? The pain's gone.

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:02.820
Hold on, that's just a pain patch! {lit: stick-on compress}

00:24:02.820 --> 00:24:04.640
Isn't that more like sleight-of-hand than real magic?

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:06.020
I get the feeling it's more than that. {XXX Not super sure about this; I hear 「手品なんてすらないような。。。」)}

00:24:06.020 --> 00:24:10.400
To remove that bad taste from your mouth, we'll show you some amazing sleight-of-hand next time!

00:24:10.400 --> 00:24:14.010
Next time on Shugo Chara: One, Two, Three! Heart Magic!

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:15.870
One more for muscle pain!

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:17.710
Oh, that feels so good!

00:24:16.860 --> 00:24:17.710
Amu-chan.

00:24:17.710 --> 00:24:19.270
She's like an old man.
